{
  "_doc": "Lumi's Character Builder (systems/lumi_style.gd, ui/lumi_builder.gd). A style is a dict of slots: colour slots (paint, trim, accent, eyes, side, glow, hover, laser) take any swatch the player has unlocked (or any colour once the advanced picker is unlocked); part slots pick one option id each. Option fields: acc = PatchModel-native add-on names (PatchModel.VARIANTS acc ids, built by PatchModel itself), parts = add-on mesh names looked up in the add-on library (aurora.glb + designs.glb, first one found wins; a procedural fallback named by build is used when none exists). unlock (absent = free): {design: id} unlocked with that design; {lumi_level: n}; {achievement: id}; {cond: achievement-style condition, text}; {cost: {parts|cubes|seeds: n}} bought once in the builder. Part slots: pattern (wear pattern and its panels), eye_shape, head (head piece), ears (ear lenses and side pieces), chest (plate icon), shoulders, held (left claw), hip, companion; the first option of a slot is its empty one. The six designs are presets that fill every slot (LumiStyle.preset).",
